{%- comment -%}
  fmx-payment-icons: copy of snippets/mgx-payment-icons.liquid from the tryscent.co magyx.co-look
  theme (tryscent-co-shopify-theme@main) for the FM product page test. Rendered by
  snippets/fmx-variant-selector.liquid under the buy button.

  Payment methods row: Shopify's own full-colour icons, one line, per market. A fixed list per
  market, not shop.enabled_payment_types: that one lists only Shopify Payments methods and changes
  with the shopper's market. The lists are what each market's checkout offers (confirmed by Adrian
  22.10.2026, Swish and Vipps live at checkout). No SEPA, no Amex / Diners / Discover / Amazon.

  To change a market: edit its list below (Shopify payment icon names, comma separated, in the
  order shown). Names used here: swish, mobilepay, vipps, klarna, visa, master, apple_pay,
  google_pay, paypal. An icon Shopify cannot draw is left out instead of printing an error.
  Countries outside SE / DK / FI / NO get the Swedish list.

  Styles are inline below (the live theme has no magyx-brand.css). Root font-size is 10px, so px.

  Usage:
  {% render 'fmx-payment-icons' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign fmx_pay_se = 'swish,klarna,visa,master,apple_pay,google_pay,paypal'
  assign fmx_pay_dk = 'mobilepay,klarna,visa,master,apple_pay,google_pay,paypal'
  assign fmx_pay_fi = 'mobilepay,klarna,visa,master,apple_pay,google_pay,paypal'
  assign fmx_pay_no = 'vipps,klarna,visa,master,apple_pay,google_pay,paypal'

  case localization.country.iso_code
    when 'DK'
      assign fmx_pay_list = fmx_pay_dk
    when 'FI'
      assign fmx_pay_list = fmx_pay_fi
    when 'NO'
      assign fmx_pay_list = fmx_pay_no
    else
      assign fmx_pay_list = fmx_pay_se
  endcase
  assign fmx_pay_types = fmx_pay_list | split: ','
-%}
<style>
  .fmx-pay-icons { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; max-width: 400px; margin: 32px auto 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .fmx-pay-icons > li { flex: 0 1 38px; min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  .fmx-pay-icons__icon { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
</style>
<ul class="fmx-pay-icons" role="list" aria-label="Betalningsmetoder">
  {%- for type in fmx_pay_types -%}
    {%- capture fmx_pay_icon -%}{{ type | strip | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'fmx-pay-icons__icon' }}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      data-wg-notranslate: each icon carries its brand name as SVG <title> ("Visa"), and Weglot read
      that as the Swedish verb ("Vis", "Vise", "Näytä" for screen readers on /da-dk /no-no /fi-fi).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if fmx_pay_icon contains '<svg' -%}
      <li data-wg-notranslate>{{ fmx_pay_icon }}</li>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
</ul>
